description:
*A damn pigeon sent by the government to spy on people. Think it hasn’t found you yet?*

Rigged 3D model of Spioniro Golubiro from famous Italian Brainrot Meme. With wing and feathers controllers.

**Features:**

* Game ready;
* The model of Pigeon is fully rigged;
* Coat, hat and glasses are not connected to main rig (you can connect them, if you want);
* The structure of the 3D pigeon model makes it possible to create realistic animations of real pigeon behavior;
* The wing feathers are hidden on this model as they will be visible through the coat, however they are present in the exchange files.

**🎁 This model is available in the BlenderKit library: 👉 [https://bit.ly/Chpndl]**

